Z||000000||BN Boomer||03-07-2001||09:32 AM||||Like the title says, sometimes you just forget how great the Fiero really looks, especially, IMHO, the fastback GTs. The other night I was driving along in my Suburban in the city of Everett and came to a stoplight where 2 totally riced out Accords and a sweet silver fastback GT were already stopped. I just couldn't help but admire the lines of the GT, especially in comparison to those dorky rice-boys. Unfortunately, I wasn't able to catch up to the Fiero and give him a thumbs up before he turned off.||||reg||14
