Z||000007||DavidHenshaw||03-07-2001||11:16 PM||||IMHO the Fiero is as close as you can get to the sexy Italian sports car look without spending a gazilian dollars. <P>BTW was driving my white 86 GT the other day and in my rear view mirror saw what I thought was a black Fiero. When it got to the light it was a fiero but some other dark color (it was dark out). Anyway light turns green and he rips around the corner. I thought I was the only one who drove that way.<P>Dave||||reg||1
